<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All my iniquities on Him were laid,</l><l>All my indebtedness by Him was paid;</l><l>All who believe on Him, the Lord hath said,</l><l>“Hath everlasting life.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Though poor and needy, I can trust my Lord;</l><l>Though weak and sinful, I believe His word;</l><l>Oh, glad message; every child of God</l><l>“Hath everlasting life.”</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Though all unworthy, yet I will not doubt;</l><l>For him that cometh He will not cast out:</l><l>“He that believeth”—oh, the good news shout!</l><l>“Hath everlasting life.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
